p=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=310a7c70077172c57166a6f99f3be870, https://si.imgix.net/72fa1aab/uploads/origins/79876f42-baa4-4362-abec-a5390206f2e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0f9226513bcbeb567c5ddda8d8272ac4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/72fa1aab/uploads/origins/79876f42-baa4-4362-abec-a5390206f2e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e9a9fb7742f97bacfc73722c50a8f37b 3x"}, "body": "A concept draiwng depicting Inashat, Mother of the Swarm, one of the bosses from my Vampire: Dark Ages campaign. She is a Baali priestess, right hand and childe of the Prince of Damascus. She is a middle-aged woman, her body swollen and misshapen, as if she were permanently pregnant with something… unnatural. Her black robes, stiff with dried blood, hang heavily over her deformed figure.\nHer face is almost completely hidden beneath a hood, but those who manage to glimpse it will see sickly, ash-colored skin and eyes shining with madness.\nA scarab brooch adorns her chest, similar to the one worn by Alharith/Abdiel.\nIdeally, she should be cutting open her \"pregnant\" belly with a dagger, letting a swarm of insects loose.", "nc": 160, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Grimmjow1903/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3670625, "client_id": 2174688, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/18b9c6c0/uploads/origins/e13ad0cb-3f45-4334-88e1-abf226738b86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=86218bab477335ec497fa64e8bb151e9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/18b9c6c0/uploads/origins/e13ad0cb-3f45-4334-88e1-abf226738b86?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=86218bab477335ec497fa64e8bb151e9, https://si.imgix.net/18b9c6c0/uploads/origins/e13ad0cb-3f45-4334-88e1-abf2